BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2147c0d2-ebb1-3b4d-84db-3f8896a25ab3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
